# This starter needs no secrets or variables: @dwk/webfinger and @dwk/host-meta
# are stateless and configured in src/index.ts.
#
# Every line below is deliberately commented out. The Deploy to Cloudflare button
# reads this file and prompts for each uncommented KEY= as a Worker secret, so
# don't uncomment them here. Copy to `.env` (gitignored) instead.
#
# --- `npm run deploy` without `wrangler login` (CI, non-interactive shells) ---
# Token needs Workers Scripts:Edit. wrangler reads both from the shell or `.env`;
# with no `.dev.vars`, `wrangler dev` also loads `.env` into the Worker's `env`.
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
#
# --- Composing more @dwk packages in ---
# Add the secrets their Env fragments declare (see spec/packages/<name>.md)
# here uncommented, e.g. `TOKEN_SIGNING_KEY=`, and the Deploy button will ask
# for them. Locally, put their values in `.dev.vars` (template: `.dev.vars.example`).
